{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Quest log: a reconnect to a character still in the world drops the 0x8F6 capability",
  "contract": [
    "The extended quest log capability belongs to the client that announced it. After HELLO (0x8F6) the server sends one 0x8F7 snapshot. When a new session takes over the character still in the world (native reconnect, no login hook), the new client has not announced 0x8F6: a Kobold Vermin (6) kill credited to the overflow quest Kobold Camp Cleanup (7) sends no 0x8F7. Once the new client sends HELLO it receives a full snapshot again."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "quest_log_size": 64,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 20
    }
  ],
